
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
ConnectorPinout                    	N/A                 	N/A       
ConnectorType                      	N/A                 	N/A       
CurrentUsage                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
HeightAllowed                      	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
LengthAllowed                      	N/A                 	N/A       
Manufacturer                       	N/A                 	N/A       
MaxDataWidth                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Model                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Number                             	N/A                 	N/A       
OtherIdentifyingInfo               	N/A                 	N/A       
PMESignal                          	N/A                 	N/A       
PartNumber                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PoweredOn                          	N/A                 	N/A       
PurposeDescription                 	N/A                 	N/A       
SKU                                	N/A                 	N/A       
SerialNumber                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Shared                             	N/A                 	N/A       
SlotDesignation                    	N/A                 	N/A       
SpecialPurpose                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
SupportsHotPlug                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Tag                                	N/A                 	N/A       
ThermalRating                      	N/A                 	N/A       
VccMixedVoltageSupport             	N/A                 	N/A       
Version                            	N/A                 	N/A       
VppMixedVoltageSupport             	N/A                 	N/A       

